                                    <TextBlock Text="✓ (Done): Marks the singer's current song as finished, automatically checks the next incomplete round checkbox to log it in history/database, and populates the Song/Artist fields with their next queued song or first pending request if available (otherwise clearing the fields)." Margin="10,0,0,0" Foreground="{DynamicResource MaterialDesignBodyLight}" />
