                                    <TextBlock Text="✓ (Accept Request): Adds a pending patron request to the rotation. If the singer is already listed, it avoids duplicate entries. If they have no song listed, it fills in their song/artist; if they already have a song, it queues it up as their next song." Margin="10,0,0,0" Foreground="{DynamicResource MaterialDesignBodyLight}" />
