                                        <TextBlock Text="• DJ Banner Window: Select a target screen for your DJ Banner under Settings and toggle it on to display full-screen borderless branding banners (supports PNG, JPG, JPEG, GIF, BMP, and looping MP4 video)." Margin="0,2" Foreground="{DynamicResource MaterialDesignBodyLight}" />
                                        <TextBlock Text="• Deconfliction Logic: If you select the same screen for both the DJ Banner and the main Rotation Display, the Rotation Display takes priority. The DJ Banner will automatically hide when the Rotation window is enabled or moved to that monitor, preventing any overlap collision." TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,2" Foreground="{DynamicResource MaterialDesignBodyLight}" />
                                    </StackPanel>
                                </Border>
                            </StackPanel>

                            <!-- Topic: Connect & Wi-Fi Instructions -->
                            <StackPanel x:Name="ConnectHelpPanel">
