                                        <TextBlock Text="• 🎮 Manual DJ Mode (Auto-Run unchecked): Questions load in a 'standby/reading' state with the timer paused, allowing the DJ to read the prompt over the microphone. The DJ starts the countdown clock on demand (Spacebar or 'Start Question &amp; Timer' button), adjusts pacing using timer bumps, and manually triggers answer reveals and question progression (Next ⏭)." Margin="0,3" Foreground="{DynamicResource MaterialDesignBodyLight}" TextWrapping="Wrap" />
                                        <TextBlock Text="• ⚡ Automatic Mode (Auto-Run checked): The entire game runs unattended. Question timers start counting down immediately upon loading, wrong answers are eliminated automatically, correct answers are revealed after countdown, and the engine automatically advances to the next question after a 5-second reveal buffer." Margin="0,3" Foreground="{DynamicResource MaterialDesignBodyLight}" TextWrapping="Wrap" />
                                    </StackPanel>
                                </Border>
